The IChatClient interface is not found in the expected paths. Since the original code uses the type IChatClient from the namespace Microsoft.Extensions.AI, I will try to use that namespace and type in the test. Also, the AddHttpClient extension method is missing, so I will remove that from the test and rely on the default HttpClientProvider behavior.

I will submit a revised test file that uses the Microsoft.Extensions.AI.IChatClient type and mocks the ILoggerFactory service to cover the call to IServiceProvider.GetService on line 56 in the original code.

